{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"北角春秧街單位起火無人傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-NP-261116-20.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】北角春秧街有單位起火，無人受傷。</p><p>起火單位玻璃窗碎裂，外牆熏黑。下午約三時許，春秧街55號宜安大廈有單位起火，消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約20分鐘後救熄，單位內5人自行撤離，大廈約40名居民亦自行疏散。初步調查相信有拖板電線短路起火。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T12:58:06.971569+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T12:14:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T20:49:51.548746+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T12:51:32.635162+00:00","content_hash":"e9bc3e746b5876433f2b7223c3ff17c12c4663609ce3451e59d30c7a1168c719","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}